From df1ae71700ef1c2b825a159b43bf56ebc64d02ab Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: "Armin Le Grand (collabora)" <Armin.LeGrand@collabora.com>
Date: Wed, 22 Apr 2026 14:13:42 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] CairoSDPR: allow direct use of small cairo_surface_t

When isCairoCompatible and we can get cairo_surface_t
directly from Bitmap for small instances (used 160x100
here, can be adapted) use directly. There is no need to
prepare for MipMapping, so spare the
SystemDependentDataHolder buffering for that cases.
For more information, see comments in commit.

